{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/02/09/3715173/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼  cmnt　read　39　.   ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんいつも有難う御座います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ！∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなってごめんなさい   ;  ;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、5thの作製をいろいろと頑張っています！\n有難いことに、雑誌の取材などにも色々と出させて頂いて、忙しくさせて頂いていますっ本当に感謝です！\n有難う御座います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日はちょっと遠くにきています ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠くだけど、\n富士山が見えるよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/02/09/3715173/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、星がキレイです ＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにも見せてあげたいなあー**"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのみんなと、沢山わちゃわちゃしていたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にぎやかですっ(* ^o^ *)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまとせいたん♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/02/09/3715173/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒がりなので、カイロ１１枚貼ってがんばっています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも、寒いので風邪ひかないように気をつけてくださいね(｡> <｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/02/09/3715173/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、乃木坂ってどこ？見てくださった方、有難う御座います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒットソングのコーナーでは、\n森山直太朗さんの「さくら」を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなろってぃーとコラボして歌えて\n嬉しかったです(#^.^#)きゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーとは一緒にカラオケに行ったりしてて、実は、どこかで一緒に歌披露するの、自分の中で夢だったんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、叶ってすごく嬉しかったです(*pωq*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだだけど、歌うこと大好きなので\nもっと頑張りたいなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなんといっても足ツボが\n痛かったです(白目)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は、テレビで見たことあるやつだあー！って感じで、ちょっとわくわくしてたんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完全に足ツボマットくんをみくびっていました。\n足ツボくん、ごめんなさい(白目土下座)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、泊りがけなんですが、らりんとなぁーちゃんと同じ部屋だから嬉しいです ♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかよし3人(#^.^#)きゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、いい夢みてね～ ○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あでゅ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/02/09/3715173/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっぴんでごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/02/09/3715173/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/02/09/3715173/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src